  "failure_conditions": [
    "An atom (the Fano plane or census 58) minus a line that leaves its ports a non-constant pattern, or split at a point so that it excludes anything but the constant pair.",
    "A gluing line where creation by some far side changes with the order of the line's points.",
    "An entry of the creation map that differs from the entry in the space keeping only the atoms holding the removal and the gluing line, or plane glue that creates on its own."
